<title>FRANCE: Electrafina raises Suez stake.</title>
<headline>Electrafina raises Suez stake.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgium's Electrafina, an affiliate of Bruxelles Lambert GBL, informed French stock markets' authority SBF that on December 4 it raised its direct and indirect stake in Compagnie de Suez to 5.06 percent.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +331 4221 5452</p>
</text>
